{"id":"kharkiv","name":"Kharkiv","qid":"Q42308","country":"Ukraine","locality":"Kharkiv Raion","lat":"49.9925","lon":"36.231111111","built":"1654","year":1654,"year_text":"1654","century":"17th century","era":"Early modern","period":"","date_basis":"Wikidata, inception","style":"","heritage":"","type":"city in Ukraine; centre of oblast","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kharkiv","text":"Kharkiv, also known as Kharkov, is the second-largest city in Ukraine. Located in the northeast of the country, it is the largest city of the historic region of Sloboda Ukraine. Kharkiv is the administrative center of Kharkiv Oblast and Kharkiv Raion.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kharkiv","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-057b09cb2ccd","w":1280,"h":853,"title":"Успенський собор взимку, аерофото.jpg","credit":{"text":"Ekaterina Polischuk","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%A3%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80_%D0%B2%D0%B7%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BA%D1%83%2C_%D0%B0%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BE.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"battlefield-1942--kharkov","game":"battlefield-1942","name":"Kharkov","verified":false,"text":"standard The city of Kharkov (Ukrainian: Харків, Russian: Харьков) was subject to four battles between the Soviet Union and Nazi Germany in World War II. In the first battle, in October, two German armies surrounded the city and captured it. In the second battle, in May 1942, the Soviets attempted to retake the city but were stalled by counterattacks and then cut off from their objective by a German flanking attack.","text_source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/Kharkov","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-4f714688f292","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Kharkov_Eastern_Bank_5.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-06-29"}},{"id":"gh-6d7762434077","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Kharkov_Eastern_Bank_4.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-06-29"}},{"id":"gh-c156b11c1cab","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Kharkov_Eastern_Bank_2.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-06-29"}},{"id":"gh-e46fb7aa1958","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Kharkov_Eastern_Bank_1.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-06-29"}},{"id":"gh-f8a2006a16c2","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Kharkov_German_Base_1.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-06-29"}},{"id":"gh-fcfcabe1ee8a","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Kharkov_Eastern_Bank_3.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-06-29"}}]},{"id":"call-of-duty--kharkov","game":"call-of-duty","name":"Kharkov","verified":false,"text":"Kharkov may refer to: Kharkov Outskirts - A mission in Call of Duty: United Offensive. Kharkov Station - A mission that appears after Kharkov Station in Call of Duty: United Offensive. Kharkov (Map) - A multiplayer map in Call of Duty: United Offensive.","text_source":"https://callofduty.fandom.com/wiki/Kharkov","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-a18ce